  "description": "Across the Olympics, athletes in red won more - until the machines took over scoring, and the advantage vanished. A look at how the color you wear quietly hijacks the judgment of whoever is keeping score, from the mat to the courtroom. Sources in the video notes.\n\nMusic: \"Wholesome\" by Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com) - Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)",
